  "notes": "Installer now updates only the selected Discord branch; Stable, PTB, and Canary use separate Equicord packages so the other clients may stay open.\n\nExisting settings stay in their original directory. The restart updater accepts the current package size.\n\nAdded optional Bookmarks and Performance plugins from reqonpublishes/vencord-custom-plugins, pinned to 1f7b95444018907324580a72437220faffadad75 with lifecycle fixes. Enable them in Plugins. Attribution is included in THIRD_PARTY_PLUGINS.md. This release does not include every public or private GitHub plugin.\n\nUserRadar has Watchlist and Activity Log tabs, presets, per-user controls, statistics, search, filters, import, and export. Activity rows load in batches and the message cache is limited to watched users.\n\nToken Importer accepts copied tokens with surrounding quotes and invisible formatting, reports storage failures more clearly, and preserves unreadable account files. Verify & Add and saved-account switching were tested with fixtures; live Discord sign-in still needs user verification.\n\nValidation: targeted ESLint, TypeScript, production build, mocked Token Importer tests, installer tests, and package hash verification."
}

